  "title": "Transcription profiling of rat bladder after inoculation with bladder cancer cells",
  "description": {
    "en": "Rat bladder cancer cells (AY-27 cell line) were inoculated intravesically into syngeneic female Fischer rats. The bladder was analyzed by histology and Affymetrix GeneChips and compared to bladders from sham operated and normal rats."
